      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. regarding the data security part, what kind of specific measures should i be taking to make sure info doesn't get leaked or accessed by people who shouldn't see it? i'm worried about stuff like hackers or even just accidental leaks from employees seeing things they don't need to. is there a standard way to prevent those 'hidden' or sneaky ways data might get compromised?",
